INSERT INTO help_content (id, tenant_id, key, audience, locale, short_text, long_md, version, status)
VALUES (
  gen_random_uuid(),
  NULL,
  'admin.dashboard.home.checklist',
  'admin',
  'en',
  'Six steps from a new assessment to released results. Each step ticks when your data shows it is done.',
  $$## Run an assessment

The checklist follows the most recent assessment. Work through the six steps in order.

1. **Create or pick an assessment.** Start a test or open an assessment.
2. **Add candidates.** Add candidates to the assessment.
3. **Send invitations.** Candidates receive an email. The step ticks when a candidate opens an invitation.
4. **Watch attempts.** The step ticks when a candidate starts the test.
5. **Grade and review.** The step ticks when no attempt waits for grading.
6. **Release results and certificates.** The step ticks when at least one result is released.

When all six steps are done, the checklist hides. Use **Show the assessment checklist** to open it again.
$$,
  1,
  'active'
) ON CONFLICT (tenant_id, key, locale, version) DO NOTHING;

