  'admin.blueprints.page',
  'admin',
  'en',
  'Exam blueprints show the sections, marks and timing of each official exam. Read only.',
  $$## Exam blueprints

A blueprint sets the structure of a full mock test: the sections, the number of questions, the marks, the negative marks and the minutes.

- **Read only.** You cannot change a blueprint on this page.
- **Start a mock.** Use Start full mock to create a draft test from a blueprint. You still publish it yourself.
