INSERT INTO help_content (id, tenant_id, key, audience, locale, short_text, long_md, version, status)
VALUES (
  gen_random_uuid(),
  NULL,
  'candidate.result.retake',
  'candidate',
  'en',
  'Try again starts your next attempt. You see how many attempts you have.',
  $$## Try again

Some assessments allow more than one attempt. When you have an attempt left, you see
"Try again" under a result that is not a pass.

- **A new attempt is a new test.** The timer starts when you press the button.
- **Your earlier result stays.** You can see it in your results list.
